  "question": {
    "text": "A plane passing though the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0,</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and making an angle <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> with the plane <math><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> also passes through the point"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1,</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
